; d3d11_x.def — ERA (Xbox One) D3D11.x import lib (phase 5).
; The layer translates these to a real desktop D3D11 device; see
; docs/ERA-GDK-MAPPING.md. D3D11XCreateDeviceX's 3-arg form
; (params struct, device, context) follows the public Xbox One
; shim-DLL d3d11.x.cpp (XDK-derived). D3DMapEsramMemory and
; DXGIXPresentArray signatures follow the same source.
; Ordinals are the Xbox One shim-DLL d3d11_x.dll ordinals:
; D3D11XCreateDeviceX @4, D3DMapEsramMemory @9, DXGIXPresentArray @11.
; ERA titles import by NAME, so the ordinal rows never affect them —
; they only matter for a title that imports by ordinal. The real
; console ordinals are unknown; the shim-DLL layout is the only
; available one.
; D3D11XCreateDevice / D3D11XCreateDeviceAndSwapChain have no known
; real ordinal (no ERA title in the layer's surface imports them) and
; export by name only. D3DAllocateGraphicsMemory / D3DFreeGraphicsMemory
; are supporting infrastructure (Xbox One shim-DLL ordinals 6 / 8) and
; also export by name only.
LIBRARY d3d11_x
EXPORTS
    D3D11XCreateDevice
    D3D11XCreateDeviceAndSwapChain
    D3D11XCreateDeviceX @4
    D3DMapEsramMemory @9
    DXGIXPresentArray @11
    D3DAllocateGraphicsMemory
    D3DFreeGraphicsMemory
